Hi all, happy nethackers.

This game as usual was played on NAO, because it's the only way for me
to avoid cheating like savescumming...

As a Neutral Female Gnomish Wizard, it starts like any other before,
as I start with a wand 1 square away from me that become to be a WoW.
So, move to this unidentified wand and take it (autopickup ON),
Engrave Elbereth with fingers, then Engrave Elbereth with wand...

Then, first wish at T:3.
#1 2 blessed scroll of charging (get 2)
#2 blessed greased +2 SDSM  (get +2)
#3: nothing happens...
OK, it was (0:2) apparently... Use one scroll of charging.
#3 (again) 2 blessed tins of Green Dragon meat (thanks to RGRN, as I
wouldn't have wished for that before reading a recent thread)
...
(wait from some extra Xplvl here)
...
#4 blessed fixed +2 Staff of Aesculapius (really great for neutral
wizard, I think, both in early and mid-game... and end-game!)
#5 blessed fixed greased +2 speedboots
#6 blessed fixed greased +2 gauntlets of dexterity (I started with a
magic marker, if it weren't the case, I would have probably go for
one
instead of [GoD.)
Note that I also managed to find 2 blessed magic lamps in the mines,
so I kept one for light, and the other went for the PYEC...
Again, StaffoA is really useful. Best artefact to wish for Neutral
wizard (or any Neutral char, except Healers), I think.
I kept it until the end... PYEC was not really useful. Due to this
game rings.

As this game was a "no problem ascending" one, I decide to target #1
on NAO. (in fact #2, as nethack score does not matter if one ascend or
not).
Note that I already tried this once, notably with forgetting to drop
Magicbane when offering the Amulet, where I would have got the
expected result. 9 months later, just try it again...
I know that this is something not for good player, but I'm not a good
player, and, at least, this had never been done before (AFAIK). This
was my challenge...

Then, not much to say, but I went through pudding farming. That was
the only quick way to get what I was expecting: wait until a 3rd wand
of wishing (after the one got from castle, and the first one starting
the game).

Got MagicBane at the end by offering, and wield it instead of The
Staff.

Oh, yes, forgot to mention that I use the polyself trick.
First, get two rings of increase Con, +5/-3 and two helms of
brilliance +7/-5, (could get better, but not that useful) then using
this (wonderful) Staff, combined with pudding, I get something like HP:
9000 PW:10000.
Then, use the Staff again to go down to XP:1 and combined with lots of
"oLS, get with around HP:1M PW:1M.
This has been the target of lot of flames on #nethack ("You hear the
tones of courtly conversation"...)
Is this a bug or a feature?
Well, I use this as a feature. Until next release where it may be
fixed (looking to nethack.org bugs) drain level with adapted =oGC and
[HoB would be enough. Just a matter of time... (that would also be
fixed in next release).
Also, pudding farming a lot, extended to its max, and combined with
alchemy, will enable anybody to get max HP & PW.

If I look closely to the NAO top 100 score, as far as I can say, I
think that there are only a maximum of 5 or 6 (including myself) that
are ranked here without using this trick or, or a drain level dance
trick.

Well, flame me if you'd like too...

Then after mapping the whole dungeon, go for the ascension run.

Not a lot to say, again, till I reach the astral plane. (around 5 or 6
"mysterious force", and 3 Rodney)


On the astral plane:

First try was left, were Pesty was standing. Not the right altar. (no
need for me to use other known "bugs")
Then move to right where Death was standing.

Somewhere in, I lost MagicBane!
Don't know how, but I find myself fighting an Angel bare handed...
(first real threat in that game!)
Well, switch to the Staff.

Right altar was the good one, were I decide to build my Rider farm...

