NAO was laggy, that, in my mind is the main cause of crash in the
game, so need some few recovers. (almost 20 in the whole game)
(thanks again, paxed!)

To limit problems (not sure this was really useful), every 100K
points, I changed myself into a xorn (after killing death again), then
cross the boulder and take everything under Death's square, put in
BoH, then put a wand of cancellation within it to make some cleansing.

Note that I use confused scroll of create monsters to fill in the
