Finger of Death (or Magic makers to write them down), Detect Monsters,
Remove Curse (Remember I lost Magicbane somewhere...), and Charm
Monster. Do not think that I used any other spellbooks here.
Also scroll of charging (used while confused).
That's all I used, I think. All other items were destroyed. (put into
BoH, after what /oC into it, as I mentioned before)


Then, after a while (around 400K points?), a stupid silver dragon
appeared on the place of Death corpse was lying... reflecting MM
without being harmed.
I should have felt less hassle, but did not notice, so I was obliged
