Combined with killing a co-aligned priest, I lost all my protection.
(-39 -> -30 AC). Not a real problem...

Unless that when I lure new rider (Famine) in my farm, I get somehow
fully cursed, with a two-weapon in hand, no holy water nearby except
in my bags that I was not able to loot, with no free hands,
Same thing to cast "Remove Curse" without free hands.
Same thing with praying (God angry).

Hopefully, I had still a wand of polymorph and my ring of polymorph
control on hand.
After finding out that Lichen were extinct (you feel lichen-ish: how
